  "body": "> The following terms are defined in the WHATWG Fetch standard: [FETCH]\n> - [...]\n> - `about:blank`\n\nThe Fetch Standard doesn't mention the term `about:blank` anywhere. It defines how to handle this special URL in https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#basic-fetch but doesn't use that term when doing so.\n",
